{"version":1,"content":"<p>跟異性約會，守時好重要，你有冇試過遲到呢？</p><p>耐不耐遲到一、兩次，對方可能會體諒，但係經常性遲到，就算你係型男或索女，一樣會受到黑面對待！</p><p>呢個時候自然要諗計補鑊，今日出場嗰班脫星索性以身相許，等伴侶可以喺床上將慾火同怒火一鋪過發洩晒出嚟！</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T15:24:07.238079+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T15:00:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T15:17:21.498682+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T15:17:21.498682+00:00","content_hash":"61f7fd5f849b5761426711b678438ed25ffdbdcf89af144c75ee091a6c0d2706","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}